## .gitignore · personapi-dotnet
## Base: github/gitignore (Dotnet + VisualStudio), recortado al alcance del
## Laboratorio 1 (monolito ASP.NET Core MVC + EF Core + SQL Server).
## Regla: nada de binarios, cachés ni secretos; sí código, scripts SQL,
## contratos, documentación y archivos de proyecto.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Compilación y salidas de MSBuild
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
artifacts/
publish/
[Pp]ublish[Oo]utput/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.cache
*.ilk
*.tlog
*.binlog
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Visual Studio / VS Code / Rider
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
*.sln.docstates
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.userosscache
*.csproj.user
*.dotCover
*.DotSettings.user

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# ASP.NET Core y herramientas EF Core
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt
*.ldf
*.mdf
*.ndf
*.bak
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
# Nota: el proyecto es Database First (el DDL de scripts/ es el origen del
# esquema). No se excluye ninguna carpeta Migrations/: si apareciera, debe
# verse en el diff y discutirse en el PR, no quedar oculta.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paquetes NuGet
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
packages/*
!packages/build/
*.nuget.props
*.nuget.targets

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pruebas y cobertura
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
TestResults/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*
CodeCoverage/
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
coverage*.info
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
*.opencover.xml
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Configuración sensible y secretos
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
appsettings.Development.json
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.*.local.json
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.publishsettings
PublishProfiles/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sistema operativo y temporales
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
~$*
*~
*.tmp
*.swp

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# LaTeX del informe académico (docs/informe)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.lot
*.out
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
